Audited 70 conditional-truncation numeric theorem declarations; only the permitted three axioms.
Actual expected conditional covariance discrepancy is at most 6*v_T; the covariance route uses C0<=2*T^2 and the actual Markov tail budget.
The polynomial threshold endpoint and optimization require separate assembly.
